# Data and domain

## Datasource

Remote APIs are Chopper services in `data/datasource/`, with a `create()` factory (see `NewsApi`). Generated client: `*.chopper.dart`.

## Repository

`@LazySingleton()` in `data/repo/`. Talks to datasources and returns DTOs or domain models. No `get<T>()` inside the class.

```dart
@LazySingleton()
class NewsRepository {
  late final NewsApi newsApi;

  @PostConstruct(preResolve: true)
  Future<void> init() async {
    newsApi = NewsApi.create();
  }
}
```

DTO → domain mapping lives in an extension next to the repository (`SourceX.toModel()`).

## Use case

`@Injectable()` in `domain/usecases/`, named `LoadNewsUC`, `SaveArticleUC`, and so on. One public `call(...)`. Orchestrates repositories and returns a domain model.

## Logging

Do not log API keys, tokens, or passwords.
